{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"34":{"eng-name":"Supplication","ara-name":"كتاب الدعاء"}},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":3827,"hadithnumber_last":3892,"arabicnumber_first":3827,"arabicnumber_last":3892}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3828,"arabicnumber":3828,"text":"Rapporté par Nu'man bin Bashir : Le Messager d'Allah (ﷺ) a dit : « L'invocation, c'est l'adoration. » Puis il a récité : « Et votre Seigneur a dit : Invoquez-Moi, Je vous répondrai. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":2},"chapter":{"id":1,"ara-name":"باب فَضْلِ الدُّعَاءِ","eng-name":"The Virtue of Supplication","isFirstHadith":false}}]}